2. Select Door in the timeline so its crosshair shows up.
3. Start your drag right on that crosshair and drag it to the middle of Door's left edge. Door should stay where it is.

Before you drag, press **A**, then **Shift+P**, so Anchor Point and Position both show. That way you can watch both of them change.

Give it a go and say "done" when you've set it. I could show you on Needle first, if you like.

